---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative overflow-x-hidden">
  <svg
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 blur-3xl opacity-80"
    width="50%"
    height="100%"
    viewBox="0 0 400 400"
    fill="none"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g clip-path="url(#clip0_17_60)">
      <g filter="url(#filter0_f_17_60)">
        <path d="M128.6 0H0V322.2L332.5 211.5L128.6 0Z" fill="#4D07E3"></path>
        <path d="M0 322.2V400H240H320L332.5 211.5L0 322.2Z" fill="#4C00FF"
        ></path>
        <path d="M320 400H400V78.75L332.5 211.5L320 400Z" fill="#B5BFF1"></path>
        <path d="M400 0H128.6L332.5 211.5L400 78.75V0Z" fill="#7fcef3"></path>
      </g>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <filter
        id="filter0_f_17_60"
        x="-159.933"
        y="-159.933"
        width="719.867"
        height="719.867"
        filterUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feFlood flood-opacity="0" result="BackgroundImageFix"></feFlood>
        <feBlend
          mode="normal"
          in="SourceGraphic"
          in2="BackgroundImageFix"
          result="shape"></feBlend>
        <feGaussianBlur
          stdDeviation="79.9667"
          result="effect1_foregroundBlur_17_60"></feGaussianBlur>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</section>
<section class="relative border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mt-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div
      class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <img alt="Birdsnest" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/birdsnest-2.webp">
        <!--<iframe class="w-full aspect-video rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cuFbSEM17Q?si=v8xUq456KOL-Be50" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>-->
      </div>     
      
    
      <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
        OVERVIEW
      </h2>

      <p>
        At Birdsnest, the shopping experience is designed to feel like being part of a supportive flock, where wardrobe dilemmas are solved with ease and retail therapy becomes a joy. Founded by Jane Cay, who combined her passions for fashion, IT, and empowering women, Birdsnest has grown into a unique online store that inspires confidence. 
</p>
<p>
  With over 85,000 women sharing their preferences, Birdsnest has developed nine in-house labels, offering a mix of exclusive styles and curated pieces to meet their customers' diverse needs.

      </p>
       <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
              <h2 id="account-terms">CHALLENGE</h2>
      </h2>

      <p>
        As a major clothing brand with multiple sub-brands, Birdsnest faced significant challenges in offering gift cards across their omnichannel platform. The large volume of visitors to both their online store and multiple physical locations only added to the complexity. Compatibility issues between their Legacy POS system and BigCommerce created obstacles, halting the launch of a streamlined, easy-to-manage gift card program.</p>
<p>
  They needed a vendor who could quickly bridge the gap between their e-commerce platform and POS system, delivering a tailored solution that worked seamlessly across all channels.</p>

<div class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <RoundedGrid />

  
  </div>

    
      <h2 id="account-terms">SOLUTION </h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Point of Sales Migration (LegacyPOS to ConnectPOS)</h3>
             <p>Birdsnest's outdated Legacy POS system was creating significant challenges with their BigCommerce platform, hindering the setup and operation of their online and in-store gift card program. This not only affected their efficiency but also led to a decline in revenue.</p>
<p>Recognizing the urgency, 99minds quickly stepped in with a seamless migration solution, “ConnectPOS.” This solution not only resolved the existing issues but also positioned Birdsnest for future growth, enabling them to successfully integrate gifting options into their omnichannel store.

              </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Setting Up ConnectPOS System</h3>
             <p> When transitioning to a new Point of Sales system, Birdsnest anticipated significant challenges, particularly with data migration and feature integration. They needed a vendor capable of ensuring a smooth transition and providing ongoing support for post-transition issues. </p>
             <p>
              Leveraging their expertise, 99minds delivered invaluable support by seamlessly connecting the new POS system, ConnectPOS, to BigCommerce. 
            </p>
             <p>
              “The 99minds team not only resolved major connectivity issues but also optimized the gift card program's operational efficiency, ultimately enhancing the overall customer experience” 
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>OmniChannel Gift Card Setup</h3>
              <p> Managing an omnichannel gift card campaign was challenging for Birdsnest due to their online POS and multiple offline stores. 99minds recognized these difficulties and worked closely with Birdsnest to implement a seamless set of solutions, all managed under a single dashboard. </p>
              <p>With features that allowed easy tracking of both online and offline gift card sales through accessible reports, the campaign's efficiency improved significantly. Thanks to 99minds' expertise, Birdsnest’s omnichannel gift card program now runs smoothly, offering customers a seamless shopping experience across all channels.

              </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center mt-8">
        <img alt="Birdsnest" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="600" height="464" src="/assets/case-study/Women-Fashion-Birdsnest-1 1.webp">
      </div>
     
      
        <div class="relative items-center w-full mx-auto mt-12 lg:p-10 lg:rounded-3xl lg:border bg-vulcan-900 border-vulcan-800" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #202130 , #2C2F48);">
          <h3 class="mt-1 mb-0 ml-3">Technology Stack :</h3>
          <div class="xl:grid xl:grid-cols-2 xl:gap-8 text-lg text-white">
              <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-1 md:gap-8">
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    99Minds Gift Card Payment API
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Bigcommerce API
                  </li>
                  </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-1 md:gap-8">
                <ul>
                <li>
                  ConnectPOS Sales System
                </li>
                <li>
                  Point of Sales Migration(ConnectPOS)
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
